{"unit_id":"tag:08MG:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是带环拓扑斯（ringed topos）。一阶加厚（first order thickening）<MATH_0002> 称为 <TEXTITOPEN_0001>平凡的（trivial）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，如果存在带环拓扑斯的态射（morphism of ringed topoi）\n<MATH_0003>，它是 <MATH_0004> 的左逆（inverse）。选择这样的态射（morphism）<MATH_0005> 称为此一阶加厚（first order thickening）的 <TEXTITOPEN_0002>平凡化（trivialization）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。给定 <MATH_0006>，可得到分裂（splitting）\n<MATH_0007>，这是 <MATH_0008> 上的代数（algebras）层（sheaves）的分裂，方法是用 <MATH_0009> 分裂满射（surjection）<MATH_0010>。反过来，这样的分裂（splitting）确定了态射（morphism）<MATH_0011>。<MATH_0012> 的带平凡化的一阶加厚（trivialized first order thickenings）的范畴（category）等价于（equivalent）<MATH_0013>-模（modules）的范畴（category）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed topos","target_term":"带环拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚"},{"source_term":"trivial","target_term":"平凡的"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"带环拓扑斯的态射"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"左逆"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚"},{"source_term":"trivialization","target_term":"平凡化"},{"source_term":"splitting","target_term":"分裂"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"splitting","target_term":"分裂"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"trivialized first order thickenings","target_term":"带平凡化的一阶加厚"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价于"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed topos","target_term":"带环拓扑斯","context":"加厚的对象。"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚","context":"平方零加厚。"},{"source_term":"trivial","target_term":"平凡的","context":"本定义的性质。"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"带环拓扑斯的态射",